<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.796 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.796 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   6.796	 6.76-6.81   6.792</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 17)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   6.852	 6.82-6.88   6.880 (Aug 21)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 20)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS700 million   6.747	 6.73-6.76   6.767</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 16)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
